  "articleBody": "Improving kitchen storage starts with matching cabinet capacity to the way your household cooks, shops, and uses appliances. A professional remodel can combine drawer bases, pantry storage, corner solutions, and layout changes while accounting for clearances, existing walls, plumbing, electrical work, materials, and permits. The best plan prioritizes frequently used items within easy reach instead of simply adding cabinets.",
